  "headline": "Maresca asks Manchester City to focus on Liverpool",
  "summary": "BBC Sport reports that Manchester City manager Enzo Maresca has urged his players to concentrate on football as the club appeals a Premier League ruling over financial rule breaches. He says the squad returned from international duty in good spirits and is focused on Sunday’s trip to Liverpool. City remain top of the table. Erling Haaland also called for players and supporters to stay united. City deny wrongdoing, and their appeal is ongoing.",
